  "description": {
   "en": "Kumagai, an otaku boy, is writing a romance novel set in another world, based on his beloved classmate, Naito. The heroine is, of course, himself. He absolutely cannot let Naito know about it---, but one day, Naito finds out that he is the author of the fantasy romance novel---!?\n\n(Source: Comic Days)"
